  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to MRC on Pumped Storage Hydropower Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the Mekong River Commission&#x2019;s Proactive Regional Planning Project. It provides the Commission with technical assistance and analysis to assess opportunities for integrated water-energy planning, including pumped-storage hydropower. The investment also provides related technical assistance to the Commission&#x2019;s Member Countries. The goal of the investment is to support the Commission and Mekong countries to a) use water resources more flexibly to deliver a broader range of services, b) accelerate energy transition, and c) undertake sustainable development with low environmental and social impacts.</narrative>
  </description>
